
<!doctype html>
<html lang="mn">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>For You — Love Site</title>

  <style>
    :root{
      --pink-main:#ff9fc7;
      --pink-dark:#e774a8;
      --pink-soft:#ffe5f2;
      --bg:#fff7fb;
      --text:#242424;
      --radius:26px;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
    body{
      font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      background:linear-gradient(120deg, #ffb6d9, #ffe6f2, #ffd4eb);
      background-size:300% 300%;
      animation: shineMove 12s ease infinite;
      color:var(--text);
      padding-bottom:60px;
      
    }

    header{
      padding:40px 22px;
      text-align:center;
    }
    header h1{
      font-size:52px;
      font-weight:800;
      color:var(--pink-dark);
    }
    header p{
      margin-top:8px;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:18px;
    }

    .wrap{
      max-width:1080px;
      margin:0 auto;
      padding:20px;
    }

    .section-title{
      font-size:32px;
      font-weight:700;
      margin:40px 0 20px;
      color:var(--pink-dark);
    }

    .hero{
      background:var(--pink-soft);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      padding:50px 30px;
      display:flex;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:space-between;
      gap:20px;
    }
    .hero-text{
      flex:1;
      min-width:260px;
    }
    .hero-text a{
      font-size:42px;
      font-weight:800;
      line-height:1.2;
    }
    .hero-text p{
      margin-top:14px;
      font-size:18px;
      color:var(--muted);
    }
    .hero-img{
      flex:1;
      text-align:center;
      min-width:260px;
    }
    .hero-img img{
      width:90%;
      border-radius:20px;
      box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(255,159,199,0.25);
    }

    .card{
      background:var(--card);
      border-radius:var(--radius);
      padding:24px;
      margin-bottom:20px;
      box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }

    .timeline-item{
      padding:18px;
      border-left:6px solid var(--pink-main);
      margin-bottom:18px;
      background:#fff7fc;
      border-radius:18px;
    }
    .timeline-item h3{
      font-size:20px;
      font-weight:700;
    }
    .timeline-item span{
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:14px;
    }
    .timeline-item p{margin-top:6px;color:#444}

    .reason{
      background:var(--pink-soft);
      padding:18px;
      border-radius:18px;
      margin-bottom:12px;
      border:2px solid var(--pink-main);
      font-weight:500;
    }

    .btn{
      background:var(--pink-main);
      padding:12px 22px;
      border:none;
      color:white;
      border-radius:16px;
      font-weight:700;
      cursor:pointer;
      font-size:16px;
    }
    footer{
      margin-top:50px;
      text-align:center;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-size:14px;
    }
    .btn {
    background: #ff9fc7;
    border-color: #e774a8;
    padding: 16px 28px;
    border-radius: 26px;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    border: none;
}
.btn:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}
.btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.95);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}
.as{
    padding-top: 10px;
    padding-left: 27.55vw;
}


  @keyframes shineMove{
      0%{background-position:0% 50%;}
      50%{background-position:100% 50%;}
      100%{background-position:0% 50%;}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
  </header>

  <div class="wrap">

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h2>БИ ЧАМД ХАЙРТАЙ</h2>
        <p>Энэ бол чамд зориулсан миний жижигхэн бэлэг.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-img">
        <img src="orig.jpg" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="section-title">Чамайг хайрлах шалтгаанууд</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="reason">Чиний инээмсэглэл.</div>
      <div class="reason">Чи нүд.</div>
      <div class="reason">Чиний яриа.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="as">
        <a href="https://hennegen.github.io/HAIR/">
        <button class="btn">Жижиг тоглоом</button>
        </a>
    </div>

    <footer>© Танд зориулав — Миний сэтгэлээс</footer>
  </div>



















  
</body>
</html>
